Z||000000||operator64||04-24-2001||03:44 PM||||   I want in to get the Fiero inspected today and the signals were not working, so the guy told me he would check the fuses and see if that was the problem. Well as i was inside the office talking to a few other customers i seen the guy upside down inside the car with his feet out my sunroof, i went out and told him there is an easier way to check them and he was a bit upset already and asked how, so i told him to get out and i'd show him.  He got out and i reached in and swung the pod down and said there that is much easier, needless to say i went down the street to get my inspection finished.  It was a good laugh.<BR>||||reg||10
Z||000001||JSocha||04-24-2001||05:50 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> The fuse box swings down?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"><P>Guess I won't get sick anymore stretching on my back under the steering wheel  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>Again, something new I have learned today.||||reg||1
