Z||000005||JSocha||04-25-2001||10:33 AM||||firstfiero:<P>1)  Go back to bed<BR>2)  Get up on other side of bed (hopefully the sunshine is also better on this side as well)<BR>3)  Watch for "P" in todays bowl of Fruit Loops<BR>4)  If "P" is discovered...do not eat Fruit Loops!<BR>5)  Rest of us, hope firstfiero is in better mood.<P>J/K! firstfiero J/K!<P>Todays footnote to everyone else:<BR>"Smile if you are crabby...don't ruin the rest of an already perfectly bleak and miserable day about to come for someone else!"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
